{
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie1": "这次就别起来了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie2": "倒下了吧。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie3": "我笑个不停。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie4": "我需要更常做这种事。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie5": "又少一个。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie6": "嗯。真满足。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie7": "反正你早就死了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie8": "我会怀念你的。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie9": "下一个。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie10": "闻着内脏味。太棒了！",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie11": "看到了吗，就该这么干。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie12": "干净利落。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie13": "那感觉……真是……太对了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie14": "不用谢。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie15": "真有趣。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie16": "感觉不能再好了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie17": "天啊，我太爱这感觉了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie18": "这简直就是疗愈！",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie19": "我可以整天做这个。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillZombie20": "嘘。现在都结束了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer1": "你曾经也有名字。真有趣。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer2": "人真是脆弱。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer3": "我一直想念这种感觉。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer4": "别往心里去。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer5": "你看我的眼神不对。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer6": "你本该待在家里的。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer7": "你的东西归我了。你不需要了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer8": "没有私人恩怨。好吧……也许有一点。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer9": "那声尖叫真是悦耳。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer10": "嗯。你比我预想的撑得久。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer11": "抱歉。算了，我一点都不抱歉。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer12": "我想那么做已经有一阵子了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer13": "至少我们中有一个人玩得开心。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer14": "这世界现在又少了一个麻烦。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer15": "呼吸啊。哦，等等。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer16": "你就不该来这儿。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer17": "没人看见就不算谋杀。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer18": "替我向上帝问好。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer19": "真够乱的。但值得。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnKillPlayer20": "你知道吗？我很需要这个。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie1": "我可以整天做这个。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie2": "你感觉到了吗？",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie3": "那声音真好听。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie4": "我曾经也对一只狗这么做过。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie5": "再来。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie6": "别动。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie7": "精彩的部分来了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie8": "哦，你还在动。有意思。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie9": "来啊，反抗一下。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie10": "我忍了很久了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie11": "疼吗？应该疼的。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie12": "你让这变得太简单了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie13": "这总是让我感觉很好。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie14": "鲜血飞溅。我太爱了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie15": "这一下是为我自己。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie16": "太美了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie17": "我好奇你是否还能感觉到什么。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie18": "你不还手。真令人失望。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie19": "嘘。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnHitZombie20": "我几年前就该这么做了。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart1": "好了……游戏时间到！",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart2": "哦，我会很享受这个的……",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart3": "又来了……",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart4": "我们来把墙壁涂满！",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart5": "我们来把地面涂红！",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart6": "你吓尿裤子了吗？",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart7": "这里马上就要变成吓尿城了！",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart8": "我希望你穿了你的拉屎裤！",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart9": "我的手甚至都没在抖。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart10": "我现在能举起一辆车。",
  "IGUI_PlayerText_OnFrenzyStart11": "疼？什么疼？",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought1": "它在你身后。小心！",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought2": "如果……如果我剥了他们的皮会怎样？",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought3": "我猜……我可以吃掉他们……？",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought4": "把他们的骨头扯下来。把他们的骨头扯下来！",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought5": "我被咬了！快看我的咬伤！",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought6": "让其中一个咬你一口，就试试看。",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought7": "我可以就这么……把自己的胳膊扯下来。",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought8": "我不知道能用他们的皮做什么……",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought9": "我想喝他们的血。等等。我应该喝他们的血吗？",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought10": "捅自己一刀。让我们看看红色。",
  "IGUI_PK42_IntrusiveThought11": "要是我放火烧了我的基地呢？连我一起烧在里面？",
  "IGUI_perks_Insanity": "疯狂",
  "IGUI_perks_MentalHealth": "精神健康",
